cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use these workflows, please cite them and the works they build on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Spatial Transcriptomics Workflows
abstract: 'Three end-to-end workflows for sequencing- and imaging-based spatial transcriptomics built
  from open-source Pennsieve apps: Spatial Domain Mapping & Condition Comparison, Cell-type Deconvolution
  & Niches, and Single-cell Spatial Profiling.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/workflow-spatial-transcriptomics
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- spatial-transcriptomics
- transcriptomics
- visium
- xenium
- merscope
- cosmx
- workflow
- spatial-domains
- deconvolution
- cell-cell-communication
